1
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:53,000
Aren't you afraid

2
00:00:54,340 --> 00:00:56,340
that everything will happen again?

3
00:00:59,040 --> 00:00:59,840
Sorry,

4
00:01:00,780 --> 00:01:02,180
I forgot.

5
00:01:08,980 --> 00:01:10,080
It's getting late.

6
00:01:10,740 --> 00:01:11,640
Let's go back.

7
00:01:32,420 --> 00:01:33,240
Chief Zhou,

8
00:01:33,440 --> 00:01:35,100
I want to ask about Hengsheng.

9
00:01:36,680 --> 00:01:38,340
Hello?

10
00:01:39,400 --> 00:01:41,340
Mom, when is Dad coming back?

11
00:01:43,280 --> 00:01:44,380
Your dad will be back soon.

12
00:01:44,380 --> 00:01:45,440
You go study first.

13
00:01:51,380 --> 00:01:52,380
Hello, Lawyer Li.

14
00:01:54,180 --> 00:01:56,509
When exactly will my husband be released?

15
00:01:58,539 --> 00:02:00,280
Don't tell me it's not optimistic.

16
00:02:00,280 --> 00:02:01,740
I want to know the details.

17
00:02:04,680 --> 00:02:06,040
Go ask for me right now.

18
00:02:06,240 --> 00:02:07,140
Understood?

19
00:02:10,380 --> 00:02:10,979
That's it.

20
00:02:25,680 --> 00:02:26,220
Ah Long.

21
00:02:26,740 --> 00:02:28,140
What exactly is going on?

22
00:02:28,240 --> 00:02:29,700
Lingze betrayed the boss.

23
00:02:29,840 --> 00:02:31,440
I need to send you abroad immediately

24
00:02:31,440 --> 00:02:33,240
to prevent him from hurting you.

25
00:02:35,240 --> 00:02:36,370
What about you guys?

26
00:02:36,700 --> 00:02:37,430
Don't worry.

27
00:02:37,820 --> 00:02:39,280
I'll arrange everything.

28
00:02:39,780 --> 00:02:40,780
After you leave,

29
00:02:41,600 --> 00:02:42,730
I'll take the blame.

30
00:03:06,280 --> 00:03:06,860
Mr. Ling,

31
00:03:07,400 --> 00:03:08,600
what should we do now?

32
00:03:09,380 --> 00:03:10,510
I'm a little scared.

33
00:03:10,740 --> 00:03:12,270
What are you panicking for?

34
00:03:12,480 --> 00:03:14,080
It's just a little accident.

35
00:03:14,740 --> 00:03:15,800
Keep an eye on them.

36
00:03:16,480 --> 00:03:18,480
Everything goes according to plan.

37
00:03:18,640 --> 00:03:19,440
Yes.

38
00:03:27,079 --> 00:03:28,340
What a bunch of losers.

39
00:03:28,540 --> 00:03:30,470
They can't even keep an eye on them.

40
00:03:45,180 --> 00:03:45,980
Hello.

41
00:03:46,740 --> 00:03:47,540
Attorney Gu.

42
00:03:48,200 --> 00:03:49,530
I need your protection.

43
00:03:49,600 --> 00:03:50,540
What happened?

44
00:03:51,180 --> 00:03:52,000
It's Mr. Long.

45
00:03:52,500 --> 00:03:54,160
He wants to take revenge on me.

46
00:03:54,579 --> 00:03:55,579
Where are you now?

47
00:03:55,579 --> 00:03:56,740
I'm in the car.

48
00:03:56,780 --> 00:03:58,510
But I don't know where to go now.

49
00:03:58,880 --> 00:03:59,840
Ling Heng and Shengsheng have both been taken.

50
00:03:59,840 --> 00:04:00,740
What is he trying to do?

51
00:04:00,740 --> 00:04:01,740
He's crazy.

52
00:04:02,440 --> 00:04:04,370
He killed my mother and my brother.

53
00:04:05,940 --> 00:04:07,670
Mucheng has also disappeared.

54
00:04:09,040 --> 00:04:10,780
He wants to get rid of all of us.

55
00:04:11,980 --> 00:04:13,910
He wants to seize all the property.

56
00:04:13,940 --> 00:04:15,640
Please save me.

57
00:04:16,140 --> 00:04:17,800
Why don't you come to us first?

58
00:04:18,440 --> 00:04:19,480
Okay, okay.

59
00:04:19,640 --> 00:04:21,300
I... I'll head over right now.

60
00:04:29,140 --> 00:04:30,070
What's going on?

61
00:04:30,080 --> 00:04:31,040
It's nothing, Mr. Ling.

62
00:04:31,040 --> 00:04:32,040
Just a blind fool.

63
00:04:43,640 --> 00:04:45,080
Do you know how to drive?

64
00:04:45,440 --> 00:04:46,900
I'm asking you a question.

65
00:04:59,700 --> 00:05:00,500
He's here.

66
00:05:01,000 --> 00:05:01,730
Come save me!

67
00:06:17,480 --> 00:06:18,280
Don't kill me.

68
00:06:18,780 --> 00:06:20,080
I'll give you whatever you want.

69
00:06:20,080 --> 00:06:22,680
Money, properties, I can give you everything.

70
00:06:23,000 --> 00:06:24,460
Those who betray my father

71
00:06:25,080 --> 00:06:26,440
must die.

72
00:06:27,740 --> 00:06:29,600
You're just my father's dog.

73
00:06:35,740 --> 00:06:36,340
No, no, no.

74
00:06:36,500 --> 00:06:38,120
Don't kill me.

75
00:06:38,640 --> 00:06:39,440
Don't kill me.

76
00:07:24,700 --> 00:07:25,560
Do not destroy.

77
00:07:27,420 --> 00:07:28,820
Do not destroy property.

78
00:07:41,940 --> 00:07:42,740
Yeyu.

79
00:08:00,940 --> 00:08:01,700
Chenyao.

80
00:08:02,640 --> 00:08:05,580
Chenyao, are you okay?

81
00:08:09,000 --> 00:08:09,720
Xingcan.

82
00:08:10,680 --> 00:08:11,610
Never mind that.

83
00:08:11,740 --> 00:08:12,800
I'll take you home.

84
00:08:18,040 --> 00:08:18,860
Lingze.

85
00:08:19,360 --> 00:08:20,400
Come help.

86
00:08:22,440 --> 00:08:23,770
Don't just stand there.

87
00:08:34,080 --> 00:08:34,880
Careful.

88
00:08:39,780 --> 00:08:40,840
Help me hold him.

89
00:08:46,940 --> 00:08:47,740
Come on.

90
00:08:48,880 --> 00:08:49,400
Come on.

91
00:08:49,920 --> 00:08:51,040
Help me put him in.

92
00:08:52,580 --> 00:08:53,380
Careful.

93
00:08:57,140 --> 00:08:57,860
Go to the kitchen,

94
00:08:57,860 --> 00:08:59,220
and get me a bucket of ice.

95
00:08:59,220 --> 00:08:59,780
Okay.

96
00:09:03,140 --> 00:09:04,760
Chenyao, Chenyao.

97
00:09:05,180 --> 00:09:06,180
Chenyao, wake up.

98
00:09:06,660 --> 00:09:07,480
Wake up.

99
00:09:07,840 --> 00:09:09,280
Don't scare me, Chenyao.

100
00:09:10,080 --> 00:09:11,160
Here's the ice.

101
00:09:11,160 --> 00:09:11,800
Pour it in.

102
00:09:12,400 --> 00:09:13,280
Pour it.

103
00:09:14,680 --> 00:09:16,740
It's not enough. Get another bucket.

104
00:09:16,780 --> 00:09:17,720
Hurry up.

105
00:09:42,340 --> 00:09:43,680
Chenyao, Chenyao.

106
00:09:46,580 --> 00:09:47,200
Lawyer Gu.

107
00:09:50,480 --> 00:09:51,340
Is Brother Chen

108
00:09:51,720 --> 00:09:52,420
okay?

109
00:09:53,040 --> 00:09:54,540
Doesn't he need to go to the hospital?

110
00:09:54,540 --> 00:09:54,960
No.

111
00:09:56,880 --> 00:09:57,360
Then,

112
00:09:58,020 --> 00:10:00,000
I'll go back and deal with the scene first.

113
00:10:00,000 --> 00:10:01,120
Let's keep in touch.

114
00:10:01,120 --> 00:10:01,800
Okay.

115
00:10:08,940 --> 00:10:10,140
I'll be leaving then.

116
00:11:36,940 --> 00:11:38,580
I never want to go back.

117
00:11:42,240 --> 00:11:43,560
Then don't go back.

118
00:11:45,580 --> 00:11:46,380
Then,

119
00:11:47,920 --> 00:11:49,450
can I stay with you forever?

120
00:11:51,940 --> 00:11:52,740
Of course.

121
00:12:00,580 --> 00:12:01,800
Murderer.

122
00:12:02,220 --> 00:12:03,440
Tang'er.

123
00:12:12,940 --> 00:12:13,640
Xingcan.

124
00:12:13,940 --> 00:12:14,880
Where is my dad?

125
00:12:20,100 --> 00:12:20,700
Xingcan.

126
00:12:20,700 --> 00:12:21,740
Tell me.
